Z||000009||CRAGAR||04-07-2000||09:13 PM||||88<BR>I stopped dealing with FOCOA because of too many hassles and screwups on their part.  I talked with a guy at the National Fiero meet, here in Columbus, last year who had paid his $600 in advance and still didn't have headers after 12 months.  He came to Columbus to find the FOCOA guy and demand his headers or $600 back.  I didn't stick around to watch!!!||||reg||13
